This model can be used to apply original animations on for `example move_player.wad` contains `run` 
which can be exported to `OAD` and individual `ONIM` (primary animation) files using `OpenIV` this can be imported via `OFIO`(https://www.dev-c.com/gtaiv/ofio). 

To apply any existing animation on top of this model just do the following:

1. Export the animation as described above.
2. Open the model in `3ds Max` 
3. Select the root of the skeleton `Char`
4. Open the wrench(🔧) icon and select the OFIO >ONIM > IMPORT SINGLE
5. Select the animation and do the customization to motion if any
6. Use the `OAD-Exporter` script to export a new `OAD` file with corresponding `ONIMs`
7. Import the `OAD` into `anim.img` using `OpenIV`

All credits to the original author of this model : H1Vltg3